00:10:55.633 --> 00:10:57.259
should I do a national TV show?

00:10:57.259 --> 00:10:59.827
Should I extend the fund by 10 times

00:10:59.827 --> 00:11:01.787
and do a quarter billion dollar fund?

00:11:01.787 --> 00:11:03.785
Should I quadruple down on Vayner?

00:11:03.785 --> 00:11:05.141
You know, I'm crippled.

00:11:05.141 --> 00:11:08.076
I'm crippled by options, which
is a blessing and a half.

00:11:08.076 --> 00:11:10.767
And so the hardest thing
was, in 2009, was like,

00:11:10.767 --> 00:11:12.033
is this the right thing?

00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:14.114
Don't forget, Vayner
started in 09, May of 09.

00:11:14.114 --> 00:11:17.212
Misha was born in May of
09 and Crush It! came out

00:11:17.212 --> 00:11:19.290
in October of 09.

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:21.903
So there was all those
other things going on.

00:11:21.903 --> 00:11:24.517
The struggle, the hardest thing

00:11:24.517 --> 00:11:25.987
was not starting the business.

00:11:25.987 --> 00:11:27.459
It was second guessing,

00:11:27.459 --> 00:11:30.354
was it the right use of
my time and A.J.'s time

00:11:30.354 --> 00:11:33.170
and upside and talents at the time.

00:11:33.816 --> 00:11:35.705
And that's it.

00:11:35.705 --> 00:11:37.740
I'm pissed still.

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.455
I hate Packer Nation.

00:11:39.455 --> 00:11:40.844
For a week, because actually
I don't have a problem

00:11:40.844 --> 00:11:43.457
because we don't play each
other again for four years.

00:11:43.457 --> 00:11:45.416
And the last time we were
at Lambeau we won 35 to 7

00:11:45.416 --> 00:11:46.750
and that felt good.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.103
But that was last time and
I know you're gonna say,

00:11:48.103 --> 00:11:49.324
"What happened this time?"

00:11:49.324 --> 00:11:50.744
And what happened this time was,

00:11:50.744 --> 00:11:52.387
a lot of misfortunate things.

00:11:52.387 --> 00:11:55.612
Misfortunate things that
really, really, hurt my soul

00:11:55.612 --> 00:11:58.061
and my feelings that I'm
in a state of sadness

00:11:58.061 --> 00:12:00.016
for the rest of today and
probably into tomorrow.

00:12:00.016 --> 00:12:02.749
But by Wednesday, I'll
start gathering the momentum

00:12:02.749 --> 00:12:06.008
to start focusing on the
Bears and Monday night.

00:12:06.008 --> 00:12:09.026
And I will be there at
the game on Monday night.

00:12:09.026 --> 00:12:12.091
You keep asking questions, I'll
keep trying to answer them.

00:12:12.332 --> 00:12:15.109
Oh right, question of the day.

00:12:15.109 --> 00:12:16.173
I don't know.

00:12:16.173 --> 00:12:18.700
Just tell me about
yourself in the comments.

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:20.529
I just wanna read a lot of
comments from my community

00:12:20.529 --> 00:12:22.131
and feel better so,

00:12:22.131 --> 00:12:23.849
tell me something good.

00:12:26.461 --> 00:12:28.427
And that's just not a
place where I wanna play.

00:12:28.427 --> 00:12:31.282
I don't wanna play in
the micro, so fuck you.

00:12:31.282 --> 00:12:34.506
(laughing)

